            "review_title": "Review at Kingscross",
            "review_text": "maryyeo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4531 contributions\n0\nGreat for lunch, not just breakfast!\nNov 2021\nWe usually visit for late breakfast, since we love their hearty breakfast set with crispy bacons, paired with warm freshly baked bread (favourite: still carrot bread). The kids usually orders their fluffy pancakes with fresh fruits, cream and honey on the side.\n\nDecided to drop by for lunch, and discovered they've lunch set menus too! Pleasantly surprised by their beautifully plated dishes, since we thought they were just a very normal Western restaurant. From the frothy creamy soup, to grilled octopus appetizer, to fusion ribs paired with freshly grilled sweet potato chunks, they all looked and tasted pretty good. Though a little on the pricier side, but the well-executed dishes by the chef, good service from the English-speaking manager and relaxing atmosphere by the Crescent lake more than makes up for it.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 15, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
