            "review_text": "travelpitt1977\nMiami, Florida77 contributions\n1\nDisappointed\nAug 2018 • Couples\nAccording to tripadvisor it says Italian food.. no! It is not an italian restaurant!!\nFar far really far from it(period) well they have pizza on the menu and even a pizza oven, what annoys me even more.(not to mention the option of black pizza dough..?what?) The pizza dough is pin rolled open, dried and cooked to death.. frozen pizza i cook at home tastes the same, really.\nPlease, inform the guest about your asian twist on the lamb shank! It was cooked to perfection, tender.. but vietnamese curry flavor! I expected the classic braised western style and not a curry with a hint of coconut... \nshouldn’t be so stingy on the bread.. only a small bite per person. Not even enough to consume the side spreads.\nGets 3 stars for the service staff. Polite and attentive. Also the location!! Excellent location.\nRead more\nWritten August 19, 2018",
